Method set(element, index):

    If element is null:
        Throw an exception (null values not allowed)

    If index is less than 0 OR index is greater than or equal to size:
        Throw an exception (invalid index)

    Store the old value at data[index] in a temporary variable

    Replace data[index] with the new element

    Return the old value
remove(index):

   if index is less than 0 or index is greater than size:
        throw an exception (invalid index)

   Store the element at data[index] in a temporary variable (this is the value to return)

       Starting from index up to size - 2:
           Shift each element one position to the left

       Decrease size by 1

       Return the removed element